        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "> Can you please elaborate on this?\n\nOn my lazy.nvim config, trying to update plugins when this one doesn't have `submodules = false` set, often resulted in git failing to checkout cleanly and bringing down the whole plugin sync operation.\n\nI agree it's not the best practice plugin-dev-wise, so I'm not going to insist that you add this feature, just noting it proves an effective and straightforward workaround back in lazy.",
